mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(255,255,255);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc;  border: 1px solid #000000; width: 753px;" border="1" width="512">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 133px;" width="88">
<p>1、知识目标：</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 592px;" width="424">
<p>1. 阐述牙周组织的应用解剖及生理病理机制</p>
<p>2. 阐述牙周病的新老分类、牙周炎的病因及其全身和局部促进因素</p>
<p>3. 明确各类牙周疾病的症状、检查方法、诊断、治疗方法及预后</p>
<p>4. 详述牙周序列治疗的目标和内容，包含牙周基础治疗及牙周常见手术的定义及适应症</p>
<p>5. 融汇牙周病学与牙体牙髓病学、口腔修复学、口腔外科学及口腔正畸学等学科交叉部分相关知识</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 133px;" width="88">
<p>2、能力目标：</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 592px;" width="424">
<p>1. 能够针对不同牙周疾病的临床表现，选择正确的临床检查方法进行诊断和鉴别诊断</p>
<p>2. 能合理制定各类牙周疾病的序列治疗计划</p>
<p>3. 建立牙周病学与牙体牙髓病学、口腔修复学、口腔外科学及口腔正畸学的多学科联合诊疗思维。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 133px;" width="88">
<p>3、德育目标：</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 592px;" width="424">
<p>1. 关注全人群牙周健康，树立预防为先的牙周治疗理念</p>
<p>2. 建立牙周疾病与口腔多学科疾病以及全身系统疾病的全局观</p>
<p>3. 培养既具备人文关怀，又有牙周领域科研思维的临床口腔医生</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
